<% provide(:title, 'Rhombus - Take Donations') %>

<%= content_for :head do %>
  <%= stylesheet_link_tag "mainly_static_pages" %>
<% end %>

<body>

	<div class="main-wrapper">
	
		<%= render 'shared/header' %>
		
<%= render 'shared/full_messages' %>
		<div class="section grey">
			<div class="container">
				<div class="p-t-60 p-b-60">
					<div class="row">
						<div class="col-md-8 col-md-offset-2">
							<h2 class="text-center m-b-30 sell_margin">Raise More Money For A Good Cause.<p class="sell_caption sell_margin">
								Shorten the distance between your donors’ hearts and wallets with Rhombus. Donors can contribute instantly using simple text messages on any mobile device. The results? The best fundraising conversion rate ever.</p>
								<a class="btn btn-danger btn-cons call_to_action_btn btn_one sell_margin" href="/signup">Sign up</a>
								<a class="btn btn-primary btn-cons call_to_action_btn sell_margin sell_button_two" href="/faqs">Learn More</a>
							</h2>

						</div>					
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	

	

<div class="section white ha-waypoint" >
		<div class="container">
		<div class="p-t-60">
		<div class="row">
		<div class="col-md-12 feature-list ">
			<div class="col-md-4">
			<h4 class="title">SIMPLE DONATIONS</h4>
			<p>
			No app downloads required. Rhombus takes the hassle out of giving making it simpler than ever for your donors to make cash contributions via SMS.  All transactions are billed directly to your donors’ debit card or bank account. No carrier billing.
			</p>
			</div>
			<div class="col-md-4">
			<h4 class="title">QUICK SIGNUP</h4>
			<p>
		To start making donations with Rhombus, your donors simply text “signup” to your rhombus number, and follow a signup link on their phones to create an account. In 2 minutes, they’ll be ready to make their first of many donations.
			</p>
			</div>
			<div class="col-md-4">
			<h4 class="title">REAL-TIME DASHBOARD</h4>
			<p>
		Monitor donations as they come in with the Rhombus real-time dashboard. We’ve made it incredibly easy to keep an eye on your funding goal by showing you every contribution from your donors and payouts to your bank account. 
			</p>
			</div><div class="clearfix"></div>
		</div>

				<div class="col-md-12 feature-list ">
			<div class="col-md-4">
			<h4 class="title">ONE DAY PAYOUT SCHEDULE</h4>
			<p>
		The payments you receive via Rhombus are deposited to your bank account the next business day. This applies to all payments taken during normal business hours (before 3pm PT); the funds will be deposited into your bank account the next business day. Payments processed after 3pm PT will be deposited into your bank account by the second business day.
			</p>
			</div>
			<div class="col-md-4">
			<h4 class="title">SAFE</h4>
			<p>
		Donating with rhombus is safer than debit cards or checks.  We encrypt and tokenize your donors’ payment information so no one can have access to it. 
			</p>
			</div>
			<div class="col-md-4">
			<h4 class="title">CONVENIENT</h4>
			<p>
	Give your donors more ways to contribute to your good cause. No more debit or credit card forms. No more checks. No more calling out sensitive payment information over the phone. Jumpstart donations with Rhombus.
			</p>
			</div><div class="clearfix"></div>
		</div>

		<div class="col-md-12 feature-list pricing">
			Simple pricing, just 1.5% per transaction to receive payments. We cover the monthly cost of your assigned Rhombus number, including all the messaging fees associated with the payments you receive. All card processing fees apply. Please contact us for volume pricing.
		<div class="clearfix"></div>
		</div>

		</div>
		<br>
		</div>
	  </div>
	</div>




<div class="section grey">
	<div class="container">
	  <div class="p-t-40 p-b-50 ">

		<div class="row feature-list value_prop">	
		It’s never been easier to integrate a mobile payment option into your organization. Simply complete the signup form to get your free Rhombus number, and in 5 minutes you’ll be on your way to offering the most ubiquitous payment option to your donors. Include your Rhombus number in fundraising materials, so your donors can start contributing faster immediately.

		</div>
	</div>
</div>	

<div class="section table-layout">	
			<div id="working-section" class="table-cell v-middle">	
				<div >
				<h3 class="text-white text-center custom-font no-margin">JOIN A GROWING LIST OF NON-PROFITS USING RHOMBUS</h3>
				</div>
			</div>
</div>


<%= render "shared/call_to_action" %>

<%= render "shared/footer" %>


</body>